  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0501.adelon_dramaton.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0501.adelon_dramaton.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0501.adelon_dramaton.kock1880-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0501_adelon_dramaton"><head>ΑΔΗΛΩΝ ΔΡΑΜΑΤΩΝ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="9" xml:id="kock-0501-adelon_dramaton-9" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0501_adelon_dramaton">
              <note type="source">Schol. Aristoph. Ran. 367</note>
              <note type="apparatus">τοῦτο εἰς Ἀρχῖνον, μήποτε δὲ καὶ εἰς Ἀγύρριον. μέμνηται δὲ τούτων καὶ Πλάτων ἐν Σκευαῖς καὶ Σαννυρίων ἐν Δανάῃ. οὗτοι γὰρ προϊστάμενοι τῆς δημοσίας τραπέζης τὸν μισθὸν τῶν κωμῳδῶν ἐμείωσαν κωμῳδηθέντες. cf. Plat. 133.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="12" xml:id="kock-0501-adelon_dramaton-12" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0501_adelon_dramaton">
              <note type="source">Acta Ol. 101, 2 Hippodamante archonte, si ea Io quam commemorat C. I. I 230 p. 353 Sannyrionis est. Meinek. I 263.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="10" xml:id="kock-0501-adelon_dramaton-10" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0501_adelon_dramaton">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0501-adelon_dramaton-10-l1" xml:lang="grc">φθείρεσθ᾽ ἐπίτριπτοι ψωμοκόλακες.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus 6, 261f Σαννυρίων Ἰοῖ κτλ.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="11" xml:id="kock-0501-adelon_dramaton-11" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0501_adelon_dramaton">
              <p>κεκτημένον</p>
              <note type="apparatus">i. e. δεσπότην. Bekker. Anecd. 102, 20 κυρίαν οὐ φασι δεῖν λέγειν, ἀλλὰ κεκτημένην. τὸν δὲ κεκτημένον μὴ λέγεσθαι ἀντὶ τοῦ δεσπότου. Σατυρικοῖς κεκτημένον λέγει. vix quisquam opinor dubitabit scribere Σαννυρίων Ἰοῖ (σανυρ. ἰοῖ) pro Σατυρικοῖς. Ad Io sive Platonis sive Sannyrionis pertinet fortasse fr. adespoton apud Eustath. 1484, 26. cf. Plat. 55.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>
